description:
For an international organization, we are urgently looking for a Full Remote hands\\-on Senior ServiceNow Developer / Coordinator – HR Service Delivery / Employee Center Portal.










 We are looking for a contractor, who is able to work full\\-time in CET working hours. Candidates need to be fluent in English.










**Tasks and Responsibilities:** 



* Responsible for technical design, development, unit testing, and production deployment in the assigned area;
* Ensure that the solution is aligned with the ServiceNow best practices and architecture standards throughout the whole delivery lifecycle;
* Ensure quality of technical deliverables, adherence to best practices for security, performance, health, UX, integration;
* Regular collaboration with Business Users and Business Analysts regarding gathering requirements and discussing results of the work;
* Perform Peer reviews for developments performed by Dev team;
* Sign off at the key quality gates (solution design, move to QA, move to PROD etc.);
* Ensure technical readiness of the solution for future operational support and ensure successful transition from the project team to the operational support;









**Profile:** 



* Bachelor or Master degree;
* 6\\+ years of IT working experience;
* 6\\+ years of ServiceNow experience;
* \\+1 year of experience in technical team coordination;
* Experience in ServiceNow HR Service Delivery developments, Employee Center Portal, Custom Applications developments and Platform Architecture;
* Strong experience with JavaScript, HTML, CSS;
* Expert Knowledge of ServiceNow Integration solutions;
* Strong experience in project management;
* Strong experience in Platform Governance, DevOps and Agile Delivery;
* Ability to establish and maintain the development of lifecycle processes, like release strategy, cutover and rehearsal plans, quality gates, testing, data governance, and operational support standards, etc;
* Good understanding of IT Processes and frameworks like VeriSM, ITIL, IT4IT, COBIT, etc;
* Fluent in English;
